      "id": "claim_8f654538b2e24ff890af0ceace63da27",
      "statement": "Two multi-node models cannot co-reside on the pair — a second model's warmup/boot starved or killed the Flash rank and sparkrun placement refuses a tensor-parallel rank on an occupied host (only placed 1 of 2 ranks) — whereas one solo (--tp 1) model per node does run concurrently.",
