      "id": "claim_80fbf2b73c914821833179cc22723c08",
      "statement": "sparkrun 0.3.10 has three defects to work around: self-rsync deletes symlinked HF blobs (hardlink first), digest-pinned images fail to ship to the worker (use dated tags), and --no-rm does not keep crashed containers.",
